After these three patches:

• XYZ now accepts `gutter` and hands it to the TileImage base class  
• DataTile accepts `gutter` and returns it from `getGutterForProjection()`  
• WebGL TileTexture no longer pre‐crops the image on upload; the gutter will instead be clipped at render time, avoiding edge artifacts.
